          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 9052,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "The feedback in A7 says the roasted chicken was a bit dry. I think we should just cook it for a few minutes less.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 150886,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "I agree it was a little dry. Instead of just cutting the time, which can be inconsistent during a busy service, what if we brine the chicken breasts? It's an extra step for T4 prep, but it would guarantee a much more moist and consistently cooked product. I've used this technique before and it makes a huge difference for lean proteins.",
            "mentions": [
              9052
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 84871,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "A brine is an excellent idea. The payoff in quality is well worth the small amount of extra prep time. Let's agree to add that to the recipe. That's a final adjustment.",
            "mentions": [
              150886
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "white_check_mark",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 153726,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "For the plating of the quinoa bowl in A5, it looked a bit messy when we served it. Can we define the placement of the ingredients more clearly?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 87779,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Good point. How about this: we put the quinoa down as a base, then arrange the roasted vegetables and other toppings in separate sections on top, and fan the protein out over one side? It would look much cleaner.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 9052,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "I like that. And a final drizzle of the dressing over the top. It's simple, fast for service, and looks good.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 84871,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "Perfect. That's a clear standard. Let's make that the official plating guideline for the bowl. 87779, can you update A5 with that description? Maybe add a quick photo or sketch when you have a moment.",
            "mentions": [
              87779
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 87779,
            "reply_to": "M49",
            "text": "Will do. So we are agreed on all the plating standards as discussed and documented in A5. This should cover T5.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5",
              "T5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "camera_with_flash",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
