            "speaker_id": 9052,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Alright team, we're in the home stretch. I've drafted a plan for launch week, see T11, and created the A8 Sales and Waste Log template for us to use. My proposal is we go live with the full new menu next Monday.",
