            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M54",
            "speaker_id": 150886,
            "reply_to": "M53",
            "text": "That's a good point. Launching everything at once could put a lot of pressure on the line, especially with the new prep workflows. I'd suggest a phased rollout as a risk mitigation. We could launch with the three simplest dishes on Monday—the soup, the grain bowl, and the wrap—and then add the salmon and chicken salad on Wednesday. This gives us a couple of days to get the rhythm right.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
